{"candidates":[{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690115","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690115","original":"本作的主角。阿虚其实是他的绰号，本名不明，负责故事旁白的角色。虽然故事以凉宫春日为中心，但故事是以阿虚的角度说出的。县立北高中一年五班的学生，家里有双亲跟一个妹妹，还有《凉宫春日的叹息》中捡来的公三色猫三味线。小时候渴望遇到有趣、不可思议的事件，但他明白到“外星人、未来人、超能力者、异世界人等等”都只是虚构的，便渐渐地开始习惯现实，希望平凡地度过一生，直到遇上了凉宫春日。自从被春日强行拉进SOS团后，他便常因春日的鬼主意而忙得不可开交。他是SOS团唯一的正常人，因此常会对春日的无理命令及众人对春日的服从态度感到不满并抱怨（大多是对春日及古泉的抱怨，亦是此作的特色）。对朝比奈实玖琉有好感，并能察觉到长门极微的表情变化。他也是几乎唯一一个会劝告春日的人。根据古泉的说法，他是春日“在现实世界唯一想在一起的人”。他常常要解决春日有意无意间所闯的祸，在这个时空拥有最大的煽动春日的能力。虽然他经常抱怨，但其实他是十分喜欢在SOS团的生活的。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"キョン"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"47"},"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690115","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690115","locator":null,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","type":"character"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"exact","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690115","original":"本作的主角。阿虚其实是他的绰号，本名不明，负责故事旁白的角色。虽然故事以凉宫春日为中心，但故事是以阿虚的角度说出的。县立北高中一年五班的学生，家里有双亲跟一个妹妹，还有《凉宫春日的叹息》中捡来的公三色猫三味线。小时候渴望遇到有趣、不可思议的事件，但他明白到“外星人、未来人、超能力者、异世界人等等”都只是虚构的，便渐渐地开始习惯现实，希望平凡地度过一生，直到遇上了凉宫春日。自从被春日强行拉进SOS团后，他便常因春日的鬼主意而忙得不可开交。他是SOS团唯一的正常人，因此常会对春日的无理命令及众人对春日的服从态度感到不满并抱怨（大多是对春日及古泉的抱怨，亦是此作的特色）。对朝比奈实玖琉有好感，并能察觉到长门极微的表情变化。他也是几乎唯一一个会劝告春日的人。根据古泉的说法，他是春日“在现实世界唯一想在一起的人”。他常常要解决春日有意无意间所闯的祸，在这个时空拥有最大的煽动春日的能力。虽然他经常抱怨，但其实他是十分喜欢在SOS团的生活的。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"キョン"}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e:5072f7cf3e3ee4e558fb7421aadf9c9b600b8303b8f9c61cf3da9871018ac99d:line:35","source_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e"}],"descriptions":[],"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"moegirl.character","value":"47"},"evidence_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e:5072f7cf3e3ee4e558fb7421aadf9c9b600b8303b8f9c61cf3da9871018ac99d:line:35","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e:5072f7cf3e3ee4e558fb7421aadf9c9b600b8303b8f9c61cf3da9871018ac99d:line:35","locator":null,"source_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e","status":"source_backed","type":"character"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"exact","matched_documents":[],"source_fields":{"raw_attributes":[{"evidence_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e:5072f7cf3e3ee4e558fb7421aadf9c9b600b8303b8f9c61cf3da9871018ac99d:line:35","source_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e","status":"source_backed","truncated":false,"value":["无表情","蓝瞳","光头","枪械","不悯","领带","西装","刺客","杀手","特工","克隆人","玩家角色"],"value_state":"present"}],"raw_cv_names":[{"evidence_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e:5072f7cf3e3ee4e558fb7421aadf9c9b600b8303b8f9c61cf3da9871018ac99d:line:35","source_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e","status":"source_backed","truncated":false,"value":["寺杣昌纪"],"value_state":"present"}],"raw_gender":[{"evidence_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e:5072f7cf3e3ee4e558fb7421aadf9c9b600b8303b8f9c61cf3da9871018ac99d:line:35","source_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e","status":"source_backed","truncated":false,"value":null,"value_state":"null"}],"raw_subject_categories":[{"evidence_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e:5072f7cf3e3ee4e558fb7421aadf9c9b600b8303b8f9c61cf3da9871018ac99d:line:35","source_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e","status":"source_backed","truncated":false,"value":["丹麦作品","杀手系列"],"value_state":"present"}]},"source_fields_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e:5072f7cf3e3ee4e558fb7421aadf9c9b600b8303b8f9c61cf3da9871018ac99d:line:35","field":"raw_attributes","source_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e","status":"source_backed"},{"evidence_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e:5072f7cf3e3ee4e558fb7421aadf9c9b600b8303b8f9c61cf3da9871018ac99d:line:35","field":"raw_subject_categories","source_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e","status":"source_backed"},{"evidence_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e:5072f7cf3e3ee4e558fb7421aadf9c9b600b8303b8f9c61cf3da9871018ac99d:line:35","field":"raw_cv_names","source_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e","status":"source_backed"},{"evidence_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e:5072f7cf3e3ee4e558fb7421aadf9c9b600b8303b8f9c61cf3da9871018ac99d:line:35","field":"raw_gender","source_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e","status":"source_backed"}],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"moegirl-complete-5072f7cf3e3e"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1014412","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1014412","original":"","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"轮廻の砂时计"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"episode","namespace":"bangumi.episode","value":"47"},"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1014412","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1014412","locator":null,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","type":"episode"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"exact","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1014412","original":"","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"轮廻の砂时计"}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"},{"aliases":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1913684","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","text":"47"}],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1913684","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1913684","original":"番組内容\r\n    福島県相馬の“はね駒（こんま）”（おてんば娘）りんが、仙台の女学校で英語を学び、結婚・出産を経て女性新聞記者の草分けとなる物語。１９８６年放送の連続テレビ小説。\r\n\r\n詳細\r\n    りん（斉藤由貴）を叔父・彌七の家に送る途中で、松浪先生（沢田研二）が倒れる。小野寺源造（渡辺謙）と母・やえ（樹木希林）と一緒にりんは、松浪を彼の家に運びこむ。過労による発熱で心臓も弱っているという。徹夜で看病したいというりんに、やえは自分が看病するから帰れという。りんは一旦学校に戻り授業を受けるが、夜寄宿舎をこっそり抜け出してしまう…。\r\n\r\n出演者ほか\r\n    【作】寺内小春，【出演】斉藤由貴，樹木希林，渡辺謙，ガッツ石松，二谷友里恵，沢田研二，【語り】細川俊之，【音楽】三枝成彰","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"47"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"episode","namespace":"bangumi.episode","value":"940755"},"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1913684","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1913684","locator":null,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","type":"episode"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"alias","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1913684","original":"番組内容\r\n    福島県相馬の“はね駒（こんま）”（おてんば娘）りんが、仙台の女学校で英語を学び、結婚・出産を経て女性新聞記者の草分けとなる物語。１９８６年放送の連続テレビ小説。\r\n\r\n詳細\r\n    りん（斉藤由貴）を叔父・彌七の家に送る途中で、松浪先生（沢田研二）が倒れる。小野寺源造（渡辺謙）と母・やえ（樹木希林）と一緒にりんは、松浪を彼の家に運びこむ。過労による発熱で心臓も弱っているという。徹夜で看病したいというりんに、やえは自分が看病するから帰れという。りんは一旦学校に戻り授業を受けるが、夜寄宿舎をこっそり抜け出してしまう…。\r\n\r\n出演者ほか\r\n    【作】寺内小春，【出演】斉藤由貴，樹木希林，渡辺謙，ガッツ石松，二谷友里恵，沢田研二，【語り】細川俊之，【音楽】三枝成彰","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"47"}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"},{"aliases":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1954407","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","text":"47"}],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1954407","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1954407","original":"番組内容\r\n    “陸（おか）者”と“海者”が対立する港町での、しょうゆ醸造の旧家の娘・かをる（沢口靖子）と網元の跡取り息子の波乱万丈の愛の物語。１９８５年放送の連続テレビ小説。\r\n\r\n出演者ほか\r\n    【作】ジェームス三木，【出演】沢口靖子，桜田淳子，川野太郎，柴田恭兵，根岸季衣，寺田農，鷲生功，鷲尾真知子，安藤一夫，七瀬けい子，加賀まりこ，津川雅彦，【語り】葛西聖司，【音楽】池辺晋一郎 \r\n\r\n詳細\r\n    るい（加賀まりこ）はかをる（沢口靖子）に一緒に入兆に行こうと言うが、かをるは拒む。英一郎（鷲生功）から善吉（安藤一夫）経由で惣吉（川野太郎）に、かをるの縁談が破談になったこと、かをるはまだ惣吉を好きらしい、ということが伝わる。また、英一郎はかをるに会いに行き、惣吉と結婚したいなら、かをるは入兆のお嬢様のままでいるほうがいいと忠告し、惣吉はまだかをるの絵を毎日見ているらしい、と伝える。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"47"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"episode","namespace":"bangumi.episode","value":"982109"},"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1954407","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1954407","locator":null,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","type":"episode"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"alias","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:1954407","original":"番組内容\r\n    “陸（おか）者”と“海者”が対立する港町での、しょうゆ醸造の旧家の娘・かをる（沢口靖子）と網元の跡取り息子の波乱万丈の愛の物語。１９８５年放送の連続テレビ小説。\r\n\r\n出演者ほか\r\n    【作】ジェームス三木，【出演】沢口靖子，桜田淳子，川野太郎，柴田恭兵，根岸季衣，寺田農，鷲生功，鷲尾真知子，安藤一夫，七瀬けい子，加賀まりこ，津川雅彦，【語り】葛西聖司，【音楽】池辺晋一郎 \r\n\r\n詳細\r\n    るい（加賀まりこ）はかをる（沢口靖子）に一緒に入兆に行こうと言うが、かをるは拒む。英一郎（鷲生功）から善吉（安藤一夫）経由で惣吉（川野太郎）に、かをるの縁談が破談になったこと、かをるはまだ惣吉を好きらしい、ということが伝わる。また、英一郎はかをるに会いに行き、惣吉と結婚したいなら、かをるは入兆のお嬢様のままでいるほうがいいと忠告し、惣吉はまだかをるの絵を毎日見ているらしい、と伝える。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"47"}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:18","source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:18","original":"Ambiguous tag. See one of the following:\r\n\r\n* [[playing instrument]]\r\n** see [[instrument]] for a list of musical instruments\r\n* [[singing]]\r\n* [[dancing]]\r\n* [[concert]] \r\n* [[karaoke]] \r\n* [[mu